  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu kambuŋami inakwata kuchikasa, wami nátonda, inatiyaloŋa kuwaha mumuchima wami. Nashi Spiritu yami hadi yena. Wakamwekeshela ajentili wuŋaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabilela, hela kubobola, hela kutiyakesha izu dindi hanzuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iteti dachikeka hakadikotolaku, wanda wudi nakufwindawishi hakawujimaku. Wakamwekesha wuŋaji munsaŋu yalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakazeya, hela kutiya wusweleluku, chiŋa nashi dehi wuŋaji hamaseki. Yitutu yakatalilaŋa nshimbi jindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi Yehova waleŋeli mawulu, wayitanjikili, waalili maseki niyuma yafumaŋamu, wenkaŋa antu endaŋahu muuya, wenkaŋa antu endaŋamu spiritu, nindi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Yehova nakutambikili mukuloŋa, nukukukwataŋa kuchikasa cheyi, nukukuhembaŋa, nukukuhanawikali wachitiyaŋenu chawantu ami, niwachejeji chawajentili;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwakunkumukaŋa kukaluŋalwiji, niyuma yejima yekalamu, niyitutu, niantu ashakamamu, mwimbilenu Yehova kamina kakaha, mwimbilenu tumina twakumushimeka, kufumisha kunsa yeseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niisaŋa ninyikala yekalaku yivwakuki, nyikala yashakama Kedari. Antu ashakama kuSela embi tumina, adikuwi kumawulu amapidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutiyakeshenu Yehova kulema, shimunenu jakumushimeka muyitutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakedikaneyi chedikaŋa chilobu, wakasaŋumuna akwawu neyi chelaŋa iyala wanjita, wakabidika, wakadikuwa. Wakayikoŋa ayilumbu jindi jawulobu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kunyaka namwena hohu kwami zo-o, saŋa namwenena kwami zo-o, hinukudilekesha kudila. Ichi dinu hinukukaluka nyiteti neyimumbanda wudi nakukaba nakuvwala; nukwonashana nikuhaakwila hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakisaŋana nimpidi jamaneni nŋanyanya nakúumisha niyuma yituutayiduku. Tuloŋa twakekala kwayitutu hohu, nakomisha majiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwendesha amputamesu munjila yabula kwilukawu, nukuyilombola munjilajabula kwilukawu. Kukuyawu, mwidima nukuwubalumuna wukwikala mwaana, haheŋa hakoloka. Yumiyi nakayila, hinakayishiyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akuhwelelaŋa akishi akusoŋa, elana akishi akusuŋununa nawu, Enu yenu akishi etu; nukuyifuntisha hanyima, akatiya nsonyi nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwajika matu tiyenu, enu amputamesu talenu kulonda mumoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mputamesu hinyi, hiyowu ŋamba yamuku? Wajika matu hinyi, hiyowukaŋanda kami inatumuku? Hinyi waputa mesu neyi muntu ashakama chamwena zo-o, waputa mesu neyi kambuŋaYehova? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamonaŋa yuma yayivulu, ilaŋa kuyishinshika nehi; matu indi ajikuka, ilaŋa kutiya nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hansaŋu yakuloŋa kwindi chinamutiyishi Yehova kuwaha kutúumbakesha nshimbi nakujilemesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa ntu awa ayibuwa dehi, ayipupa dehi; wejima wawu afwa dehi mutwimbila, anayisweki mumatala akaleya. Anayikwati, kwosi wukuyipulwishaku. Anayipupi, kwosi wukwila nindi, Yifuntishiliyuma yawuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadenu hadinyi wukutiyilila chumichi? Wukutiyilila atiyi yankumininaku, hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi waheni Yakoba nindi amubuwi, waheni Isarela kudi akwakumubuwa? Hidiyi Yehova itunavulumuni, wukweti njila jindi jabulili kwendawu, ninshimbi jindi jabulili kwovwahilawuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hamwichililiyi kulendumuka kwakuzuwa kwindi, niŊovujanjita; chinamukwatishili kesi kwi-ndo, yena kuchiluka nehi. Chinamwocheli, yena kuchisha kumuchima nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
